# ==============================================================================
# TRACKED BY DEFAULT REGARDLESS OF EXTENSION (last match wins; keep these last)
# ==============================================================================
# Claude companions and query documents, and the Essay 3 Query 2 working directory: these hold .md/.txt/.xlsx
# deliverables that the blanket extension rules above would otherwise hide, so new files there are tracked by
# default and must be excluded deliberately, not by accident.
!docs/claude/**
!outputs/essay3_q2/**

# ...except the raw stdout captures, which duplicate the committed *.log files (must stay after the negation above)
outputs/essay3_q2/*_stdout.txt
